3. Data

VectorFall ships no third-party data sets. The built-in samples are made by code on your computer. Some features
download public data when you ask for it (for example World Bank indicators, SEC EDGAR filings, UCDP conflict data,
Wikipedia lists and market prices). That data goes to your data folder and stays under the terms of its source.
Market prices from Yahoo are kept in memory only and are not stored.
